  "description": "SEWSEW crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H88 Dy6 N6 O32,C2 H3 N1,2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1D (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2D (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3D (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.518-4.344 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 91.71-133.81°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6(L)2(μ3-OH)4(CH3COO)8]·4CH3OH. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
